;      &lt;geometry&gt;        &lt;cylinder length="0.3" radius="0.01"/&gt;      &lt;/geometry&gt;      &lt;origin xyz="0 0 -0.45"/&gt;    &lt;/collision&gt;    &lt;inertial&gt;      &lt;mass value="0.05"/&gt;      &lt;inertia ixx="1.0" ixy="0.0" ixz="0.0" iyy="1.0" iyz="0.0" izz="1.0"/&gt;    &lt;/inertial&gt;  &lt;/link&gt;  &lt;joint name="base_to_rope" type="floating"&gt;    &lt;axis xyz="1 0 0"/&gt;    &lt;origin xyz="0.0 0.0 0.0"/&gt;    &lt;parent link="base_link"/&gt;    &lt;child link="rope"/&gt;    &lt;dynamics damping="0.0001" friction="0.0001"/&gt;    &lt;limit effort="200.0" lower="-30" upper="30" velocity="10"/&gt;  &lt;/joint&gt;  &lt;joint name="rope_to_rope" type="floating"&gt;    &lt;axis xyz="1 0 0"/&gt;    &lt;origin xyz="0.0 0.0 0.0"/&gt;    &lt;parent link="rope"/&gt;    &lt;child link="rope2"/&gt;    &lt;dynamics damping="0.0001" friction="0.0001"/&gt;    &lt;limit effort="1.0" lower="-30" upper="30" velocity="10"/&gt;  &lt;/joint&gt;</code></pre></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=13307">pedro</a> — Wed Jun 05, 2019 7:40 pm</p><hr />
